# Chapter 11's second refusal: log out with a turn pending. The transcript goes with the login, and the
# held parts that come after are dropped.
tap home.login
type account.email you@example.com
tap account.submit
clock data release auth.email_start
type account.code 123456
tap account.verify
clock data release auth.email_verify
clock data release auth.account
tap shell.new
type composer.input hello
tap composer.send
clock data release chat.send
clock data release chat.part
tap shell.logout
clock data release chat.part
clock data release auth.logout
state
state transcript
tree
